ave that nearly beaches the ship again.","who":"","kind":"AUDITORY_ACTION"},{"at":28.74,"dur":18.16,"caption":"Cyclops — if any mortal ever asks who put out your eye so shamefully, tell him this: it was Odysseus, sacker of cities, who blinded you — Laertes's son, whose home is in Ithaca!","who":"odysseus","kind":"DIALOGUE"},{"at":47.35,"dur":44.68,"caption":"So the old prophecy comes home — Telemus foretold I would lose my sight at the hands of Odysseus, and I watched all these years for a great man, not this little worthless nothing who undid me with wine. Hear me, Poseidon, dark-haired shaker of the earth, if I am truly your son: grant that Odysseus, sacker of cities, never reach his home. Or if he must, let him come late and broken, on a stranger's ship, all his comrades lost — and find trouble waiting in his house.","who":"","kind":"DIALOGUE"},{"at":92.48,"dur":7.44,"caption":"A second rock misses as the ship escapes to the fleet.","who":"","kind":"NARRATION"}],"words":[{"t":0.75,"w":"Cyclops"},{"t":1.495,"w":"It"},{"t":1.743,"w":"was"},{"t":2.074,"w":"no"},{"t":2.322,"w":"weak"},{"t":2.735,"w":"man's"},{"t":3.232,"w":"friends"},{"t":3.894,"w":"you"},{"t":4.225,"w":"ate"},{"t":4.555,"w":"in"},{"t":4.804,"w":"your"},{"t":5.217,"w":"hollow"},{"t":5.796,"w":"cave"},{"t":6.375,"w":"your"},{"t":6.789,"w":"evil"},{"t":7.203,"w":"deeds"},{"t":7.699,"w":"were"},{"t":8.113,"w":"bound"},{"t":8.609,"w":"to"},{"t":8.857,"w":"find"},{"t":9.271,"w":"you"},{"t":9.602,"w":"out"},{"t":10.015,"w":"You"},{"t":10.346,"w":"dared"},{"t":10.843,"w":"devour"},{"t":11.422,"w":"guests"},{"t":12.001,"w":"in"},{"t":12.249,"w":"your"},{"t":12.663,"w":"own"},{"t":12.994,"w":"house"},{"t":13.573,"w":"and"},{"t":13.904,"w":"Zeus"},{"t":14.317,"w":"and"},{"t":14.648,"w":"the"},{"t":14.979,"w":"gods"},{"t":15.393,"w":"have"},{"t":15.806,"w":"paid"},{"t":16.22,"w":"you"},{"t":16.551,"w":"for"},{"t":16.882,"w":"it"},{"t":17.88,"w":"Polyphemus"},{"t":18.997,"w":"tears"},{"t":19.607,"w":"off"},{"t":